    "2": {
      "note": "Tier-2 comparisons move beyond basic frames to degree expressions, the 越嚟越 (jyut6 lai4 jyut6) construction, and multi-clause comparative sentences. Key additions: 得多 (dak1 do1) and 好多 (hou2 do1) for 'much more'; 越嚟越 (jyut6 lai4 jyut6) for 'more and more'; 有冇 (jau5 mou5)…咁 (gam3) for comparison questions; 反而 (faan2 ji4) for contrary results; 其實 (kei4 sat6) for corrections.",
      "words": [
        {
          "id": "comparisons-013",
          "c": "得多",
          "j": "dak1 do1",
          "e": "Much more / by a lot (after adjective in comparison)"
        },
        {
          "id": "comparisons-014",
          "c": "越嚟越",
          "j": "jyut6 lai4 jyut6",
          "e": "More and more"
        },
        {
          "id": "comparisons-015",
          "c": "好多",
          "j": "hou2 do1",
          "e": "Much more / a lot more (colloquial degree intensifier)"
        },
        {
          "id": "comparisons-016",
          "c": "反而",
          "j": "faan2 ji4",
          "e": "On the contrary / instead (opposite to expectation)"
        },
        {
          "id": "comparisons-017",
          "c": "其實",
          "j": "kei4 sat6",
          "e": "Actually / in fact"
        },
