          "e": "This restaurant is much more expensive than that one.",
          "note": "得多 (dak1 do1) after an adjective in a 比 (bei2) comparison means by a lot — 貴得多 (gwai3 dak1 do1) much more expensive. Stronger than 貴啲 (gwai3 di1) a bit more expensive.",
