            },
            {
              "c": "貴得多",
              "j": "gwai3 dak1 do1",
              "e": "much more expensive"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sid": "comparisons-t2-s02",
          "c": "天氣越嚟越熱，我越嚟越唔想出街。",
          "j": "tin1 hei3 jyut6 lai4 jyut6 jit6, ngo5 jyut6 lai4 jyut6 m4 soeng2 ceot1 gaai1.",
          "e": "The weather is getting hotter and hotter, and I'm less and less willing to go out.",
          "note": "越嚟越 (jyut6 lai4 jyut6) + adjective or verb = more and more ___. It stacks naturally across two clauses — one describing the situation, one the reaction — which is the real Intermediate target.",
          "bd": [
            {
