          "note": "有冇 (jau5 mou5)…咁 (gam3) + adjective questions equality — 有冇佢咁叻 (jau5 mou5 keoi5 gam3 lek1) as clever as him? Contrast with 同 (tung4)…一樣 (jat1 joeng6) which asserts equality; 有冇 (jau5 mou5)…咁 (gam3) asks whether it holds.",
